OL,3,GNEWSACountryside managers prepare for
OL,4,Aclimate change
OL,5,
OL,6,FClimate change readiness and helping
OL,7,Fpeople access the countryside are among
OL,8,Fpriorities in a five-year plan for a
OL,9,Fnational landscape.
OL,11,FThe North Pennines National Landscape
OL,12,FManagement Plan 2026-31 has been
OL,13,Fadopted by the Cumberland, Westmorland
OL,14,Fand Furness, County Durham and
OL,15,FNorthumberland councils.
OL,17,FWork to ensure the North Pennines was
OL,18,F"as prepared as possible for future
OL,19,Fclimate challenges" included restoring
OL,20,Fpeatland to help reduce flooding and
OL,21,Fequipping farmers with wildfire
OL,22,Ffighting equipment such as drones.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,400,390,260,160,0,100
