OL,3,GNEWSACountryside managers prepare for
OL,4,Aclimate change
OL,5,
OL,6,FChris Woodley-Stewart, director of the
OL,7,FNorth Pennines National Landscape
OL,8,F(NPNL), said: "In many ways, its the
OL,9,Fmost ambitious plan that we've ever
OL,10,Fhad, but also the most realistic."
